{"skill":{"slug":"douyin-cover-builder","displayName":"Douyin Cover Builder（抖音封面生成器）"},"version":{"version":"3.1.3","createdAt":1791125047752,"changelog":"修复默认竖版封面比例不明确，以及示例中“竖版 4:3”与方向相矛盾的问题，避免制作竖版封面时误用 9:16。\n\n### 更新内容\n\n- **严格区分横竖比例**：所有比例统一表示宽:高。未指定画幅或仅指定竖版时默认 3:4，建议 1080×1440；仅指定横版时采用 4:3，建议 1440×1080。\n- **用户指定优先**：明确给出的比例或像素尺寸覆盖默认值，例如 1080×1080 合集封面使用 1:1；尺寸、比例与方向冲突时先澄清。\n- **统一提示词和示例**：修正 SKILL.md、README、使用说明与模板中的比例写法。模板明确填写方向、宽高比和目标像素尺寸，比例约束整张输出画布；不再固定套用 4:3，也不因视频或参考图为 9:16 而改变默认封面比例。\n- **新增交付校验规则**：实际出图后读取文件宽高，使用整数等式验证严格比例；用户指定精确尺寸时逐项核对。发现偏差须修正并重新检查，禁止非等比拉伸，交付时报告实际宽高。\n\n### 验证与范围\n\n- 用户已在新会话中验证更新后的 Skill 可正常使用。\n- 这次更新的是 Skill 指令、提示词模板和文档；尺寸校验是交付流程要求，不是新增的自动校验程序。\n- 保留关键词高亮、轻弧排版和主题配色等原有视觉规则。","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"CHANGELOG.md","size":1400,"sha256":"307812a9658a5b2400a5e4a3958072993ac3aa7a07f68e361b66e37530975e38","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"README.md","size":3383,"sha256":"6f84dcd92978646a553ac2f43ce537d6bcd3d98d3ca373ece0cf097c4ab3974f","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"SKILL.md","size":6628,"sha256":"364933dc768ba6e3a09ba77442d2f047128755b53e70ce638790a74fe1df846f","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"docs/NOTES.md","size":867,"sha256":"785c8c06dba1c2c66cc3787594025ea569c4ed8e3269f5230f2058acb49f413e","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"docs/USAGE.md","size":1420,"sha256":"096c67cbf5c8efc7dfca03e6c2c8bee79002ce472f9dbce94ea943abfe89904a","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"docs/images/preview.png","size":2068748,"sha256":"0d902fc861e779cc6aa6079fb11b83abac912fc6d8f1c486c4496489a3806b9c","contentType":"image/png"},{"path":"templates/final_prompt_template.md","size":2402,"sha256":"10396419838629530cc944cde81ffac7b3a802d2f243b9984fc4c5ba729f501b","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1880,"sha256":"0ac5b550633df783df4f79f1f7657e62fd8360ad75b2d10e74cf3a216bfc5d2c","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1791125275126,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"89adf60998aa4b502c787a30123bc5774bc9a527dcbeb190947896be3745fcfa","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/89adf60998aa4b502c787a30123bc5774bc9a527dcbeb190947896be3745fcfa","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1791125212047},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":14,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":5,"checkedAt":1791125275126},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a disclosed prompt-building guide for Douyin cover images and does not show hidden execution, persistence, credential access, or destructive behavior.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Requested behavior is proportionate to the purpose: collect topic, key points, pose/vibe, aspect ratio, and optionally a user photo; it does not ask for credentials, broad local files, account data, or privileged access.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The package contains Markdown instructions, documentation, a prompt template, and a preview image; no executable scripts, dependency installation, services, hooks, or automatic commands were found.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The skill is primarily written for Chinese creators and most instructions are in Chinese; this is a locale/audience limitation to consider, but it is visible and aligned with the Douyin-cover purpose rather than hidden or coercive behavior.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"No persistence, background workers, memory-writing instructions, privilege escalation, tool hijacking, or long-running mutation authority were present.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The artifacts consistently describe generating image prompts and art-direction notes for Douyin-style covers, including aspect-ratio rules, keyword highlighting, and optional use of an uploaded portrait for visual consistency.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Before installing, consider that the workflow is mainly documented in Chinese and may encourage uploading a portrait to an image model; only use photos you are comfortable providing to the chosen image-generation service.","findings":"[SQP-3] expected: The Chinese-language and Chinese-creator focus is real, but it is openly presented and coherent with a Douyin-specific cover-prompt skill; it does not create a security concern requiring Review.\n[A.I.G SARIF] expected: The supplied static scan reported no T01-T09 security findings, consistent with the inspected Markdown-only artifact.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1791125275126}}}}}